{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38427","headline":"和韩致光侍郎无题三首十四韵 二 · 吴融","name":"和韩致光侍郎无题三首十四韵 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舞转轻轻雪，歌霏漠漠尘。\n漫游多卜夜，慵起不知晨。\n玉箸和妆裛，金莲逐步新。\n凤笙追北里，鹤驭访南真。\n有恨都无语，非愁亦有嚬。\n戏应过蚌浦，飞合入蟾轮。\n杯样成言鸟，梳文解卧鳞。\n逢迎大堤晚，离别洞庭春。\n似玉曾夸赵，如云不让秦。\n锦收花上露，珠引月中津。\n木爲连枝贵，禽因比翼珍。\n万峰酥点薄，五色绣妆匀。\n獭髓求鱼客，鲛绡托海人。\n寸肠谁与达，洞府四无邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}